{"request":{"path":"/rest/contents/search","query":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"projection":"full","sort":"viewsCount:desc"},"body":{"operator":"and","filters":{"format":{"includes":["video"]},"publishedAt":{"after":"2026-06-27","before":"2026-09-27"}},"queries":[{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["running","runner","marathon"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["versus","comparison","compared"],"operator":"or"}},"transcript":{"includesExactly":{"values":["versus","comparison","compared"],"operator":"or"}}}}]}},"status":206,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-27T07:31:07.054Z","response":{"data":{"aggregations":{"totalViewsCount":73126010,"totalInteractionsCount":3293231,"totalEngagementRatePerViews":0.04503501558474201,"totalEngagementRatePerFollowers":0.009670051476800607},"results":[{"id":"cnt_b69254ac9343217c86797cc40f10","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"drgreeney","profileDisplayName":"Dylan Greeney MD Dermatologist","format":"video","caption":"I've gotten so many questions about the Medicube Booster Pro X2, so I answered the ones I keep seeing the biggest upgrade for me is Dual Mode, running two treatments at once basically cuts my routine time in half. But real talk, a device like this isn't magic, it's for people already consistent with their skincare who want to get more out of it. Which mode are you most curious about? #medicube #BoosterProX2 #skincare #dermatologist #skincaretools @medicube global ","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_cfbf4e493cc84861fdf98ec6c467","publishedAt":"2026-08-07T15:47:28.000Z","profileId":"prf_a6ad2c384476aad5507625b0d18e","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":11200000,"likesCount":21300,"sharesCount":878,"commentsCount":90,"interactionsCount":22268,"engagementRatePerViews":0.1988214285714286,"engagementRatePerFollowers":5.6762681621208255,"profileFollowersCount":392300,"profileFollowingCount":184,"profilePostsCount":1409,"mediaCount":1,"duration":51,"hashtags":["#medicube","#boosterprox2","#skincare","#dermatologist","#skincaretools"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[{"id":"prf_5a04c8e0b42604e5603b9f5b28c3","platformId":"6871028119319692290","profileHandle":"medicube_official"}],"platformId":"7671316784225537310","profilePlatformId":"6817473284998136837","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/drgreeney/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Dermatologist | MD\nUS Army Veteran 🇺🇸\n⬇️ My Favorite Skincare","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"I've gotten a ton of questions about the MediCube Booster Pro X2, so let me answer the top ones. And this is proudly sponsored by MediCube, so thank you for that. What's new versus the original? Three modes, dual, mask, and AI, plus a treatment head that's 30% larger, so you finish your treatments faster. Is it worth upgrading? For me, it's the dual mode. You can run two technologies at once, so you can boost absorption while firming in the same session. It basically cuts your treatment time in half. How does the booster mode work? It's electroporation. It creates tiny temporary pathways so your serums actually penetrate instead of setting on top. I pair it with lightweight peptide, PDRN, or NAD serums. And how about mask mode? It pushes sheet mask ingredients deeper, so five minutes does what usually would take 20. Where do I start? The new AI mode. It picks the mode and the intensity for your goals. MediCube Booster Pro X2 is not magic, and it's not for everyone, but if you're already consistent and have five minutes a day, it helps you get more from the skincare that you already use.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.009,"endSeconds":2.709,"text":"I've gotten a ton of questions about the MediCube Booster Pro X2,"},{"startSeconds":2.789,"endSeconds":3.889,"text":"so let me answer the top ones."},{"startSeconds":3.949,"endSeconds":6.429,"text":"And this is proudly sponsored by MediCube, so thank you for that."},{"startSeconds":6.649,"endSeconds":7.809,"text":"What's new versus the original?"},{"startSeconds":8.089,"endSeconds":12.189,"text":"Three modes, dual, mask, and AI, plus a treatment head that's 30% larger,"},{"startSeconds":12.269,"endSeconds":13.709,"text":"so you finish your treatments faster."},{"startSeconds":13.929,"endSeconds":14.849,"text":"Is it worth upgrading?"},{"startSeconds":15.009,"endSeconds":16.189,"text":"For me, it's the dual mode."},{"startSeconds":16.269,"endSeconds":17.969,"text":"You can run two technologies at once,"},{"startSeconds":18.009,"endSeconds":20.589,"text":"so you can boost absorption while firming in the same session."},{"startSeconds":20.989,"endSeconds":22.909,"text":"It basically cuts your treatment time in half."},{"startSeconds":23.089,"endSeconds":24.589,"text":"How does the booster mode work?"},{"startSeconds":24.589,"endSeconds":25.689,"text":"It's electroporation."},{"startSeconds":25.889,"endSeconds":28.649,"text":"It creates tiny temporary pathways so your serums actually penetrate"},{"startSeconds":28.649,"endSeconds":29.749,"text":"instead of setting on top."},{"startSeconds":30.009,"endSeconds":33.389,"text":"I pair it with lightweight peptide, PDRN, or NAD serums."},{"startSeconds":33.549,"endSeconds":34.449,"text":"And how about mask mode?"},{"startSeconds":34.629,"endSeconds":36.669,"text":"It pushes sheet mask ingredients deeper,"},{"startSeconds":36.849,"endSeconds":38.929,"text":"so five minutes does what usually would take 20."},{"startSeconds":39.069,"endSeconds":39.849,"text":"Where do I start?"},{"startSeconds":39.969,"endSeconds":40.829,"text":"The new AI mode."},{"startSeconds":40.969,"endSeconds":43.209,"text":"It picks the mode and the intensity for your goals."},{"startSeconds":43.449,"endSeconds":46.389,"text":"MediCube Booster Pro X2 is not magic, and it's not for everyone,"},{"startSeconds":46.489,"endSeconds":48.669,"text":"but if you're already consistent and have five minutes a day,"},{"startSeconds":48.969,"endSeconds":51.609,"text":"it helps you get more from the skincare that you already use."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_17046610aa109f699570ec2a90d4","position":1,"timestampSeconds":6.47,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/1_6.47.webp"},{"id":"med_9df2ae57c057fad51d5456a08b64","position":2,"timestampSeconds":6.51,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/2_6.51.webp"},{"id":"med_bd2d17d3416795e34ed56ebf1327","position":3,"timestampSeconds":6.57,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/3_6.57.webp"},{"id":"med_44284d259cdb05a7e7595ecf2868","position":4,"timestampSeconds":6.61,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/4_6.61.webp"},{"id":"med_48e9e8a1953e06473ad8b7e3c551","position":5,"timestampSeconds":8.54,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/5_8.54.webp"},{"id":"med_2dd75650beec55d653f2e19c7d9a","position":6,"timestampSeconds":8.58,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/6_8.58.webp"},{"id":"med_8beebd9c94fc9c0ae0a3047ed7ca","position":7,"timestampSeconds":8.61,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/7_8.61.webp"},{"id":"med_c1e2527a29663d7a6fed316616fc","position":8,"timestampSeconds":8.64,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671316784225537310/8_8.64.webp"},{"id":"med_86df5cabc28857c2ff8efc075fad","position":9,"timestampSeconds":13.78,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7671